    "detailed_description": "2024/08/21 8:30 JPT update<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAdded a normal mode where the human body model doesn't move too fast.<br />\r\nAdded mouse sensitivity settings.<br />\r\nAdded the ability to restart from the middle of a reading.<br />\r\nStopped the passage of time when reading in the library.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-------------------------------------<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&quot;Trapped in a School at Midnight&quot;<br />\r\nYou find yourself locked in a school at midnight.<br />\r\nInescapable terror, seven vengeful spirits closing in.<br />\r\nWill you fulfill their wishes, or...?<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n360-degree horror!<br />\r\nInnovative 3D action that forces you to turn around<br />\r\nThe most terrifying moment? When you turn and something is &quot;there&quot;<br />\r\n7 ghosts lurking throughout the school - Can you escape without confronting them all?<br />\r\nEach spirit has a tragic past - Choose to help them pass on or banish them<br />\r\nYour choices shape the outcome - Multiple ending system<br />\r\nSurvival horror where salt is your lifeline<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTerrifying encounters:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAn old man who wants to tie up students<br />\r\nSomeone standing on the rooftop<br />\r\nAnatomical models, pianos, and someone always behind you<br />\r\n<br />\r\nA chilling survival horror game where escape from the midnight school is at stake.<br />\r\nYour choices determine your fate and the destinies of seven souls...<br />\r\nExperience absolute terror that will make you scream - right now, in your hands.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeel free to stream or make Let's Play videos!<br />\r\nLinks would be appreciated!",
    "about_the_game": "2024/08/21 8:30 JPT update<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAdded a normal mode where the human body model doesn't move too fast.<br />\r\nAdded mouse sensitivity settings.<br />\r\nAdded the ability to restart from the middle of a reading.<br />\r\nStopped the passage of time when reading in the library.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-------------------------------------<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&quot;Trapped in a School at Midnight&quot;<br />\r\nYou find yourself locked in a school at midnight.<br />\r\nInescapable terror, seven vengeful spirits closing in.<br />\r\nWill you fulfill their wishes, or...?<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n360-degree horror!<br />\r\nInnovative 3D action that forces you to turn around<br />\r\nThe most terrifying moment? When you turn and something is &quot;there&quot;<br />\r\n7 ghosts lurking throughout the school - Can you escape without confronting them all?<br />\r\nEach spirit has a tragic past - Choose to help them pass on or banish them<br />\r\nYour choices shape the outcome - Multiple ending system<br />\r\nSurvival horror where salt is your lifeline<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTerrifying encounters:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAn old man who wants to tie up students<br />\r\nSomeone standing on the rooftop<br />\r\nAnatomical models, pianos, and someone always behind you<br />\r\n<br />\r\nA chilling survival horror game where escape from the midnight school is at stake.<br />\r\nYour choices determine your fate and the destinies of seven souls...<br />\r\nExperience absolute terror that will make you scream - right now, in your hands.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeel free to stream or make Let's Play videos!<br />\r\nLinks would be appreciated!",
    "short_description": "Here's an even shorter version, around 150 characters: &quot;Midnight School Terror&quot; Trapped with 7 ghosts. 360\u00b0 horror forces you to turn. Uncover pasts, make choices. Salt is life. Creepy figures lurk everywhere. Escape or become the 7th spirit?",
